Text: Indeed, linking individu- als’ health information from online resources to their health records to improve documentation is an active line of research (Padrez et al., 2015). Al- though it is generally easier to obtain access to social media data, the use of social media still requires similar ethical considerations as in the clinical domain. See for example the inﬂuen- tial study on emotional contagion in Facebook posts by Kramer et al.

